    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The black Item screen came from the auto-sort hook forcing Item controller state 79 before startup states 0–2 completed. I removed that state jump. The replacement applies FF8's own 198-slot compaction before the untouched Item initializer, so the normal screen startup still runs. Static and generated-patch checks pass; the repaired option still needs an in-game check.",
